## 13. DIRECTIVES

Directives modify the execution of a query.

### Built-in Directives

| Directive | Where | Purpose |
|-----------|-------|---------|
| `@include(if: Boolean!)` | Fields, Fragments | Include field only if condition is true |
| `@skip(if: Boolean!)` | Fields, Fragments | Skip field if condition is true |
| `@deprecated(reason: String)` | Schema fields | Mark field as deprecated |

### @include and @skip
```graphql
query GetUser($userId: ID!, $withPosts: Boolean!, $hideSensitive: Boolean!) {
  user(id: $userId) {
    name
    email @skip(if: $hideSensitive)         # Skip email if hideSensitive is true
    phone @skip(if: $hideSensitive)
    posts @include(if: $withPosts) {        # Include posts only if withPosts is true
      title
      content
    }
  }
}

# Variables:
{
  "userId": "1",
  "withPosts": true,
  "hideSensitive": false
}
```

### @deprecated (in Schema)
```graphql
type User {
  id: ID!
  name: String!
  email: String!
  username: String @deprecated(reason: "Use 'name' instead")
  avatar: String @deprecated(reason: "Use 'profile.avatar' instead")
  profile: Profile
}
```

### Custom Directives (Schema)
```graphql
# Define custom directive
directive @auth(requires: Role = ADMIN) on FIELD_DEFINITION
directive @cacheControl(maxAge: Int) on FIELD_DEFINITION
directive @rateLimit(max: Int!, window: String!) on FIELD_DEFINITION

type Query {
  me: User @auth(requires: USER)
  users: [User!]! @auth(requires: ADMIN)
  publicPosts: [Post!]! @cacheControl(maxAge: 300)
  sensitiveData: Data! @auth(requires: ADMIN) @rateLimit(max: 10, window: "1m")
}
```

